  "limitations": [
    "instruction-boundary producer owns arrival, interrupt-controller priority and coalescing; acknowledgment is not APIC EOI",
    "owned ordinary RAM, one CPU, fresh walks; no MMIO, TLB or concurrent writers",
    "REP/gather/XSAVE partial completion, intra-instruction asynchronous events, native providers and LOCK remain separate",
    "complete legacy i386 dispatch, SMI/software SMM and SGX enclave/AEX/EPCM remain open",
    "active unsupported TF/CET/FRED/LAM/LASS domains remain refused",
    "generated runtime binding is internal C++ plus source-only C bridges, not stable SDK C construction API",
    "Linux x64 KVM qualification; native LA57 is unavailable on this host",
    "no LLVM or NeverC source change is required for this portable lowering; no LLVM release or pin completion is claimed"
  ],
